## 2. The engine's word, per area (all green)

- the header (title/subtitle/hint from the exercise), the four metric boxes with `best`
  seeded from the stored record and `0` before a drill starts, the exercise tabs, the
  difficulty control naming the reference's four values in order, the court area, the one
